      "bone density scan - arranged by the gastroenterology team",
      "serology at six and twelve months and annual review - can be explained at the three-month visit",
      "communion wafers, play dough, frying oil, breadcrumbs - kept to the commonest hidden sources for length; play dough discussed in clinic",
      "eating out and lunch at work - agreed in clinic",
      "children's testing letter to the practice - mentioned in brief only",
      "how quickly she will feel better - answered in clinic"
