      "BP 232/136, 228/132, 230/134 other arm",
      "grade 4 hypertensive retinopathy, bilateral disc swelling, end-organ involvement",
      "headaches, nosebleeds, breathlessness, ankle swelling, chest tightness",
      "only dilating drops instilled",
      "no doctor since 2008",
      "smoker twenty a day; father died of stroke at 51",
      "no medication, no known allergies",
      "GP follow-up: BP, renal, cardiovascular risk, smoking",
