      "selection": "Plain explanations of the cause, the rules for wearing the glasses, the patching plan and the review date are kept. Prescription figures and examination detail are left out because they would not help a parent act.",
      "organisation": "Main instruction, then why it happened, then everyday glasses advice, then the review and patching plan, then timescale and when to return early.",
      "tone": "Warm, plain English and reassuring, especially in removing any sense of blame, while staying clear about what is required."
