      "selection": "The stroke and its effects, current function, the stairs problem with its temporary solution, the care package, equipment, the pending stairlift and the escalation triggers are kept. Her career, choir, library books, television charges, screening and family abroad are left out as irrelevant to rehabilitation.",
      "organisation": "Purpose, then diagnosis and impairments, then function and the home set-up, then equipment and adaptations, and finally the requests and escalation criteria.",
      "tone": "Clear, collegial handover language between occupational therapists, using shared professional terms."
