      "selection": "The hidden avoidance, his own words, his wishes, the practical adjustments and the detentions are kept because they change what teachers do. Stammering percentages, secondary behaviours, his option choices (not yet his to share) and family background are left out.",
      "organisation": "Purpose and sharing, then a short profile with his own words, then the adjustments in his own terms, then the detentions, then the examination arrangement, therapy and review.",
