      "birth at 39 weeks, motor milestones, feeding - typical and not relevant to the hearing question",
      "nursery report - repeats the listening picture already given",
      "interim strategies and hearing diary - therapy detail, not needed for the referral",
      "mother's question about catching up - answered by the family once the assessment is done",
