      "selection": "The life-threatening cuff rule, the valve timings and stop signs, the diet and fluid levels, mouth care and escalation are kept. The ICU history, FEES details and valve progression figures are left out as background the nurses do not need to act on.",
      "organisation": "Purpose and tube, then the valve plan with its safety rules and the suction rule, then swallow, feeding position and mouth care, then the overnight plan and escalation.",
