      "selection": "A teacher needs his current skills, the one remaining error with its re-referral point, practical strategies and when to re-refer. Detailed medical history, intake scores, phonological terminology, hobbies and family logistics are left out because they do not change classroom practice.",
      "organisation": "Purpose, then a short history and current abilities, then the remaining error with matching strategies, then the re-referral route.",
      "tone": "Warm and plain, avoiding clinical jargon, as the reader is an education professional rather than a clinician."
