      "gradual onset left fore lameness from November 2024, worse on hard ground and left rein",
      "deterioration despite restricted work",
      "grade 4 out of 10 on left rein, 8 April",
      "palmar digital nerve block 24 March, 70 per cent improvement, palmar foot",
      "DIP joint and navicular bursa deliberately not blocked",
      "navicular synovial invaginations, flexor cortex irregularity, medullary sclerosis",
      "farriery improved balance, lameness unchanged",
