      "herd-level investigation, three visits, unresolved",
      "since August 2025, disease within 21 days of calving",
      "14 left DAs against 3; 22 ketosis against 7; RFM 19 per cent; 11 milk fever",
      "two deaths within 10 days of calving, no post mortem",
      "NEFA raised in 5 of 6 fresh cows; low calcium",
      "drying-off BCS mean 3.6, central",
      "42 cubicles for 46 cows; feed face 58 cm",
