      "selection": "For each dog the measured findings, the advice given and the lack of progress are kept, because these are the substance of the concern; Willow's eye is flagged as urgent because it is at risk of perforation. Detailed skin, ear and dental findings, the neutering discussion and the enclosure list are left out as covered by the enclosed records.",
      "organisation": "Purpose, one paragraph per dog in order of concern, then non-attendance, refused help and the limits of the report.",
      "tone": "Formal, neutral and evidential: findings are stated without any judgement of the keeper's intent, and 'Yours faithfully' suits an unnamed recipient."
